    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βακτηρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>staff, cane,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				682
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				24.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				11.4
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συκίνη β.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐπικουρία</span>
			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Macar.
				7.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wand,</i> as a badge of office, carried by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικασταί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.210
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λαβὼν τὴν β. βαδίζει εἰς τὸ
					δικαστήριον τὸ ὁμόχρων τῇ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					65.2
				</span></i>
			. (Cf. Lat. <i>baculum, imbēcillus,</i> OIr.
				<i>bacc</i> 'crook, curved stick'.)</div>
